<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-First Boston cut Sociedad Comercial.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-First Boston cut Sociedad Comercial.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it cut its rating of Sociedad Comercial Del Plata SA to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
